	"You are a worker at a Lizard's Gas Station close to a research station.": "你是一座研究站附近的蜥蜴加油站的员工。",
	"Unfortunately, your employer has neglected some basic necessities, so you'll have to put in hard labor if you want to survive in this oppressive tin can. Hopefully someone comes by soon.": "不幸的是，你的雇主忽视了一些基本生活需求。想在这个压抑的铁罐头里活下去，你就得卖力干活。希望很快就有人路过。",
	"was 550 years ago.": "已经是 550 年前了。",
	"All the crew are just greytiders with different paint.": "所有船员都不过是刷了不同颜色的灰潮。",
	"Everyone is controlled by strings behind a glowing screen": "每个人都被发光屏幕背后的丝线操纵着",
	"How can an escape pod only take two people normally, but an infinite number of people if they're lying down?": "为什么逃生舱平时只能坐两个人，躺下后却能装下无限多的人？",
	"How come a hole in the floor doesn't suck you out into space?": "为什么地板上的洞不会把你吸进太空？",
	"How do I know the name of someone just by hearing them talk?": "为什么只听声音我就知道对方叫什么？",
	"How do I know the names of all these people that I've never met before?": "为什么我知道所有这些素未谋面的人叫什么？",
	"How do mirrors give people haircuts?": "镜子是怎么给人理发的？",
	"How do the morgue trays know whether someone's soul is still in their body?": "停尸柜怎么知道一个人的灵魂还在不在体内？",
	"How is everyone a complete expert in every threat in the universe?": "为什么每个人都是应对宇宙中所有威胁的专家？",
	"If magic is real, why aren't we researching that?": "如果魔法是真的，我们为什么不研究它？",
	"If suit sensors are so important, why don't they always start maximized?": "既然制服传感器这么重要，为什么不默认开启最高档？",
	"If two miners were in Lavaland and one of them killed the other with a pickaxe, wouldn't that be fucked up or what?": "如果两个矿工去了熔岩星，其中一个用镐杀了另一个，那不是糟透了吗？",
	"If we can wash clothes in a sink, why do we need washing machines?": "既然水槽就能洗衣服，为什么还要洗衣机？",
	"It doesn't take much for people to murder their friends.": "人们似乎不需要什么理由就能杀死自己的朋友。",
	"Nanotrasen just clones us every shift.": "纳米传讯每个班次都在克隆我们。",
	"Separation is absolute.": "分离是绝对的。",
	"Space stations are no substitute for healthy social interaction.": "空间站无法替代健康的社交活动。",
	"Space wind? How does that even make sense?": "太空风？这怎么可能？",
	"The gods are always watching, and will wipe you from existence if you fuck up.": "神明始终注视着你，一旦搞砸，就会把你从世间抹去。",
	"The ultimate god is really really stoned.": "终极之神真的嗨大了。",
	"The universe always ends after we reach CentCom.": "每次我们抵达中央指挥部，宇宙就会终结。",
	"There's no biological difference between lizards and humans.": "蜥蜴人和人类在生物学上没有区别。",
	"This is all an endless looping nightmare of misery.": "这一切都是永无止境、循环往复的痛苦噩梦。",
	"What happened to the ceiling?": "天花板去哪儿了？",
	"Where does the Cook get all this meat from?": "厨师从哪儿弄来这么多肉？",
	"Who hires all these unqualified, violent assistants?": "是谁雇了这些不称职又暴力的助理？",
	"Why are there fire alarms everywhere but no sprinklers?": "为什么到处都有火警警报器，却没有自动喷淋？",
	"Why do people just randomly murder all their friends some shifts?": "为什么有些班次里，人们会毫无征兆地杀死所有朋友？",
	"Why does Nanotrasen hire Clowns and Mimes for every single station?": "为什么纳米传讯每座空间站都要雇小丑和默剧演员？",
	"Why does space circle around on itself?": "为什么太空绕一圈会回到原地？",
	"Why is it called the emergency shuttle if it arrives every single shift?": "既然每个班次都来，为什么还叫紧急穿梭机？",
	"Why is space cold?": "为什么太空是冷的？",
	"Why is there a floor, but no roof?": "为什么有地板却没有屋顶？",
	"Why is this a plasma research station if we know everything about plasma already?": "既然我们已经完全了解等离子体，为什么还要建等离子体研究站？",
	"Why is this station so poorly designed?": "这座空间站为什么设计得这么糟糕？",
